### Decorator - saves sales.txt.gz; SGVsbG8= is Base64 for Hello
POST {{host}}/Decorator/Reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "sales.txt",
    "content": "SGVsbG8="
}

### Decorator - invalid path, expected 400
POST {{host}}/Decorator/Reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "../sales.txt",
    "content": "SGVsbG8="
}
